WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with arms overhead.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Walk both heels and shoulders to the right, making a banana shape.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep both hips grounded.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the left side waist.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Return to center and switch sides.
